  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade for Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Side Up (TSU) is the orchestrator of a worldwide coffee growing and roasting community, brought together by the vision of coffee trade based on human values instead of money. By making the value chain fully transparent (including themselves) from bean to cup, TSU aims to redistribute wealth back to the farmers in an equal and cooperative fashion. Farmers are in direct contact with roasters in Europe gaining leading to a higher price for coffee and more control of their own product. With DGGF-TA, TSU will be able to pre-finance coffee imports from longstanding partnerships in Colombia, Rwanda and the Democratic Republic of the Congo.</narrative>
  </description>
